  "coverage": {
    "mode": "explicit-classified",
    "gaps": [
      "omega-kotlin publishes no field on any of its 28 templates, so the overlay has only kind, name, path and span; a call argument is never emitted, so a source set named by a string -- sourceSets.getByName(\"androidMain\") -- cannot be read",
      "definition.modifier_candidate carries the whole modifiers text as its name, so expect/actual is matched by prefix; a declaration written 'internal expect' or 'public actual' puts the visibility first and is not matched",
      "an actual is paired to its expect by declaration name and kind alone; two same-named declarations in different packages of one project would pair wrongly, because omega-kotlin emits definition.package with a span covering only the package header, so no span join reaches it from a top-level declaration",
      "which source set a file belongs to is its directory -- src/commonMain, src/iosMain -- and the overlay cannot name a path segment, so no edge links a PlatformDeclaration to the SourceSet or PlatformTarget that compiles it",
      "Gradle plugin execution, convention-plugin effects and generated targets need build evidence the static index does not have"
    ]
  },
